title:: CaosStepGrid
summary:: Step grid for one track (UserView), with playhead and painting.
categories:: CaosBox
related:: Classes/CaosTrack, Classes/CaosBoxGUI

description::
A view for one track: it draws 32 rounded cells, gaps every 4 steps and the
playhead column. Dragging paints or clears; it does not store the pattern, that is
the job of link::Classes/CaosTrack::.

On percussion tracks, code::shift:: + click or right-click toggles a small flam
dot without changing the step gate. The flam amount and repeat count used by the
view are code::flamAmount:: and code::flamRepeats::.

On any track, code::ctrl:: + click toggles a repeater. Its icon is three dots of
2, 4 and 6 px in the upper-right corner, sharing that place with the flam dot
because a step cannot have both. The defaults used by the view are
code::repeaterRepetitions:: and code::repeaterMetric::.

