instancemethods::

method:: flamAmount
method:: flamRepeats
Defaults used when shift-clicking or right-clicking a percussion cell.

method:: repeaterRepetitions
method:: repeaterMetric
Defaults used when ctrl-clicking a cell. The repeater is stored in the track and
is independent of the view; marking it does not change the step gate.

